why Every Alliance quest of Razorfen Downs in one run.

# Razorfen Downs' Alliance quests in one guide: the pick-ups in Stormwind and
# Dalaran, Myriam Moonsinger at the door, one run, then the hand-ins. Steps
# already done are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain
# stands.
#
# The quests: Archbishop Benedictus' 3636 Bring the Light (Amnennar);
# Archmage Lan'dalock's 96773 The Coldbringer's Eye; Myriam Moonsinger's 6626
# A Host of Evil (outside the door); inside, Belnistrasz' 3523 Scourge of the
# Downs -> 3525 Extinguishing the Idol.
#
# Left out: 93604 Agamaggan's Blood, the end of the Shen'dralas chain: it
# needs Maraudon's 93404 Rot and Regret and 93601 Passing the Blame first (the
# Maraudon guide holds them).
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, Belnistrasz or the Eye
# inside, so their goals stand at the door (@49.0,93.9, The Barrens) with
# `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of a run of my own (as a Horde
# character: Tuten'kash, Belnistrasz and his ritual, Plaguemaw the Rotting,
# Glutton, Amnennar the Coldbringer, the Eye right after him). Every quest goal
# is counted by the quest log, so a group that takes them in another order
# still gets each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The Razorfen and the cultists outside are
#   elites of level 33 to 34.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - A run of my own on 2026-11-16 (Horde, five players), which the Horde
#   guide's header describes.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   37 to 46).

step Archbishop Benedictus
  tip In Stormwind. He gives Bring the Light from level 39.
  level 39
  accept 3636

step Archmage Lan'dalock
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip In Dalaran.
  accept 96773

step Myriam Moonsinger
  zone The Barrens
  tip By the dungeon's door.
  accept 6626

step A Host of Evil
  tip The Razorfen and the Death's Head Cultists around the door are elites: bring your group.
  kill 7873 x8 quest 6626.1
  kill 7874 x8 quest 6626.2
  kill 7872 x8 quest 6626.3

step Myriam Moonsinger
  turnin 6626

step To Razorfen Downs
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 37 to 46.
  enter "Razorfen Downs" @49.0,93.9

step Belnistrasz
  tip After Tuten'kash on my run. Talk to him, then protect him while he performs the ritual to shut down the idol; his brazier takes the quest back.
  accept 3523 @49.0,93.9
  turnin 3523 @49.0,93.9
  accept 3525 @49.0,93.9
  complete 3525 @49.0,93.9 group 5

step Belnistrasz's Brazier
  turnin 3525 object 152097 @49.0,93.9

step Amnennar the Coldbringer
  tip The last boss, after Plaguemaw the Rotting and Glutton on my run. The Coldbringer's Eye is close by.
  kill 7358 quest 3636.1 @49.0,93.9 group 5
  collect 276916 quest 96773.1 @49.0,93.9 group 5

step Archmage Lan'dalock
  zone Alterac Mountains
  turnin 96773

step Archbishop Benedictus
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 3636
